     figuration can be found by iterating the _i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e___i_n_d_e_x from 0 to
     _c_o_n_f_i_g___d_e_s_c_-_>_b_N_u_m_I_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e-1 and for each of these, iterating the
     _e_n_d_p_o_i_n_t___i_n_d_e_x from 0 to _i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e___d_e_s_c_-_>_b_N_u_m_E_n_d_p_o_i_n_t_s.  The _c_o_n_f_i_g___i_n_d_e_x
     should be set to USB_CURRENT_CONFIG_INDEX and _a_l_t___i_n_d_e_x should be set to
     USB_CURRENT_ALT_INDEX.

